Suggests: cinnamon
Description: animated clickable desktop wallpaper for Cinnamon/X11
 Mintland draws an animated scene behind the desktop icons on Linux Mint
 (Cinnamon/X11). The scene reacts to icon positions and keeps the icons
 clickable.
 .
 It requires Nemo, which provides the desktop icons and their positions.
 Wayland and other desktop environments are not supported.
